              "value": 8
            },
            "description": {
              "value": "While in your trance, you can blur the line between dreams and reality for others. You gain the waking dream focus spell, which you can use only while you're in a Daydream Trance.\n\nYou gain a pool of Focus Points with 1 Focus Point and you can Refocus by taking a nap for 10 minutes. You become trained in occult spell attack rolls and spell DCs, and your spellcasting ability for these spells is Wisdom."
            }
          }
        }
      ]
